  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Charges a weapon with lightning, adding 1d4 + {{math spellPower \"/\" 2}} damage on hit and changing its damage type to Physical, Magic and Lightning.</p><p>Cast inside a storm, the bonus is a further 1d4 + {{math spellPower \"/\" 2}}.</p><p>If nothing is hit by the end of the round, and the weapon is not dropped, the caster takes half the imbued damage.</p><p>Can be applied only to Melee and Thrown weapons. This spell does not count towards the limit of spells cast this round.</p>",
